(6) Tj T*
(Introduction) Tj T*
(In Day 1, we outlined the paradigm shift from traditional software development to Agentic) Tj T*
(Engineering, introducing the Factory Model where your primary output as a developer is no) Tj T*
(longer raw syntax, but the system that produces code. We defined the core architecture of) Tj T*
(this system:) Tj T*
(Software's next evolution isn't) Tj T*
(written: it's orchestrated by) Tj T*
(interoperable agents.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
