(Page 7 of 49 - 04 - Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(7) Tj T*
(If Agentic Engineering represents the factory floor you are orchestrating, then MCP, A2A,) Tj T*
(A2UI, AP2, and UCP are the Industry Standards--the uniform nuts and bolts and screw) Tj T*
(sizes, data formats, and communication channels--that allow your machinery to safely) Tj T*
(interact with the rest of the world.) Tj T*
(Without these open protocols, every agent you build exists as an isolated "custom machine") Tj T*
(in a garage. You are forced to spend your hours and tokens writing fragile, bespoke wrappers) Tj T*
(for every single tool and API connection, trapping you in a low-leverage Conductor role.) Tj T*
(By adopting standardized interoperability layers, you transform your agent's Harness into a) Tj T*
(modular, plug-and-play platform. You spend less time debugging custom JSON payloads and) Tj T*
(more time directing high-level intent as an Orchestrator.) Tj T*
(* OpenResponses & Interactions API are both "Power Plugs", modern API approaches) Tj T*
(to LLM inference which support long running tasks.  These blur the line between a) Tj T*
(stateless single turn and a stateful agent.) Tj T*
(* MCP \(Model Context Protocol\) acts as the "USB-C"  within your agent's harness,) Tj T*
(instantly connecting models to databases, filesystems, and web APIs.) Tj T*
(* Skills are "Playbooks", very simple markdown instructions and scripts or tools which can) Tj T*
(be used in a sandbox environment like a terminal.) Tj T*
(* A2A \(Agent-to-Agent\) serves as the "Factory Radio", allowing specialized agents to) Tj T*
(negotiate, brain-storm, and delegate tasks to each other.) Tj T*
(* A2UI \(Agent-to-User Interface\) behaves like a "Generative Display Window", turning) Tj T*
(raw, complex JSON outputs into safe, interactive visual components for human operators.) Tj T*
(* AP2 and UCP act as the "Global Supply Chain & Transaction Network", allowing) Tj T*
(agents to securely negotiate and execute autonomous commercial transactions.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
