(8) Tj T*
(This paper focuses on how vibe coders can rapidly utilize some of these protocols to) Tj T*
(construct a virtual data and execution team in a single afternoon.) Tj T*
(Figure 1: Ecosystem of Agent Protocols) Tj T*
(Why this paper, why now) Tj T*
(In the era of vibecoding with less structure, harnesses and protocols help build trust in) Tj T*
(the agent development process. While velocity of outcome remains the primary driver for) Tj T*
(practitioners and developers, standardized protocols allow us to expand much further) Tj T*
(in achieving complex goals by transforming isolated "custom machines" into modular,) Tj T*
(interoperable platforms. Without agreed upon open standards, developers are creating tech) Tj T*
ET
