(Page 9 of 49 - 04 - Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(9) Tj T*
(debt, each API is a standard-of-one. These are low-leverage tasks, writing fragile, bespoke) Tj T*
(wrappers for every tool, maintaining them over time and adapting to other's needs. Adopting) Tj T*
(these layers allows for a shift from being a mere builder to a high-level orchestrator.) Tj T*
(Who this paper is for) Tj T*
(This paper is specifically designed for software engineers, engineering managers, architects,) Tj T*
(and technical leaders who recognize that the shift toward Agentic Engineering requires strict) Tj T*
(adherence to protocols to maintain the fidelity and reliability of outcomes. It serves as a) Tj T*
(practical guide for "vibe coders" who prioritize speed and visual results, demonstrating how) Tj T*
(to construct a virtual data and execution team.) Tj T*
(Applied Tip:) Tj T*
(In the Day 1 whitepaper, we recommended using an AGENTS.MD file to provide standard) Tj T*
(guidance for coding agents.) Tj T*
(Always begin by thinking deeply before you code--explicitly stating your assumptions,) Tj T*
(surfacing tradeoffs, and halting to ask for clarification the moment you encounter ambiguity) Tj T*
(rather than guessing silently.) Tj T*
(Write only the absolute minimum amount of code required to solve the immediate problem,) Tj T*
(strictly avoiding speculative features, unrequested abstractions, or predictive configurations.) Tj T*
(When editing existing code, make highly surgical changes by restricting your updates only) Tj T*
(to the exact lines necessary to fulfill the request, maintaining the existing style perfectly,) Tj T*
(and leaving adjacent, unbroken code completely untouched unless your changes directly) Tj T*
(orphaned an import or variable.) Tj T*
(Finally, approach every task through goal-driven execution by breaking it down into a clear,) Tj T*
(step-by-step plan with strong success criteria, such as writing a reproducing or failing test) Tj T*
(first and independently looping through verification until that specific goal is strictly met.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
