(Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(12) Tj T*
(Configuration) Tj T*
(Before connecting, specify standard parameters detailing the server's scope and) Tj T*
(permissions. This includes setting up environment files to handle API credentials \(such as) Tj T*
(Personal Access Tokens or OAuth secrets\) and defining read/write permissions to protect) Tj T*
(your filesystem.) Tj T*
(Connection) Tj T*
(Once configured, the client establishes connection with the server. To verify the connection,) Tj T*
(the host client runs a basic handshake request to list the available tools and validate the) Tj T*
(output schema.) Tj T*
(Applied Tip:) Tj T*
(Check for pre-requisites) Tj T*
(Identify scope, access criterias) Tj T*
(Include the specifications in the coding agent) Tj T*
(Authentication) Tj T*
