(Page 13 of 49 - 04 - Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(13) Tj T*
(Bypassing the NxM Prototyping Problem) Tj T*
(To appreciate why MCP is crucial for rapid prototyping, look at the integration math. If you) Tj T*
(are experimenting with N different LLMs \(Gemini 3.1 Pro, Gemini 3 Flash, Gemini 3.5 Flash) Tj T*
(or a local open-source model\) and want to connect them to M different external tools \(Jira,) Tj T*
(BigQuery, GitHub, Google Drive\), traditional ad-hoc development requires writing custom) Tj T*
(integration code for every single model-tool intersection:) Tj T*
(If you have 5 models and 10 tools, you must maintain 50 bespoke integration points. If a) Tj T*
(single tool API changes, multiple parser loops break without a protocol in place.) Tj T*
(Snippet 1: MCP Complexity) Tj T*
(Traditional Integration:               MCP Interoperability:) Tj T*
(Models       Tools                     Models       MCP        Tools) Tj T*
([Model A] ?? [Tool 1]                 [Model A] ???        ??? [Tool 1]) Tj T*
([Model B] ?? [Tool 2]                 [Model B] ???? [MCP] ??? [Tool 2]) Tj T*
([Model C] ?? [Tool 3]                 [Model C] ???        ??? [Tool 3]) Tj T*
(Effort: O\(N x M\)                      Effort: O\(N + M\)) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
