(via an A2A Client.) Tj T*
(Connecting Remote A2A Agents) Tj T*
(In a mature ecosystem, an application does not natively possess deep knowledge of every) Tj T*
(domain it touches. Instead, it acts as an Orchestrator--a central hub whose primary) Tj T*
(cognitive load is dedicated to understanding user intent, managing the overarching workflow,) Tj T*
(and delegating specific tasks to specialized, remote A2A agents.) Tj T*
(Remote A2A agents operate as an autonomous, domain-bound contractor which) Tj T*
(communicates over the A2A protocol. Connecting to these remote agents generally) Tj T*
(follows one of two architectural patterns \(code sample from Google ADK\): direct) Tj T*
(point-to-point integration:) Tj T*
ET
