(28) Tj T*
(Snippet 2: Direct remote A2A agent instantiation via a hardcoded endpoint.) Tj T*
(or by using agent registry to discover agents:) Tj T*
(Snippet 3: Indirect remote A2A agent discovery and instantiation via an Agent Registry.) Tj T*
(The Extensibility Layer: A2A as the Foundation for UI) Tj T*
(and Commerce) Tj T*
(By resolving the fragmentation inherent in the early AI ecosystem, A2A protocol establishes a) Tj T*
(unified communication layer which in turn enables developers to build atop this standardized) Tj T*
(substrate. While the core A2A protocol functions as a transport and negotiation backbone,) Tj T*
(realizing rich, transactional applications very often demand highly specialized capabilities.) Tj T*
(Python) Tj T*
(# 1. Direct Instantiation via Hardcoded Endpoint) Tj T*
(# Ideal for specific vendor integrations or private agents) Tj T*
(billing_specialist = RemoteA2aAgent\() Tj T*
(name="billing_agent",) Tj T*
(endpoint="https://api.vendor.com/v1/billing/a2a") Tj T*
(\)) Tj T*
(Python) Tj T*
(# 2. InDirect Instantiation via Agent Registry) Tj T*
(registry = AgentRegistry\(project_id=project_id, location=location\)) Tj T*
(#The registry resolves resource names and handles authentication validation) Tj T*
(agent_name = f"projects/{project_id}/locations/{location}/agents/YOUR_AGENT_ID") Tj T*
(my_remote_agent = registry.get_remote_a2a_agent\(agent_name=agent_name\)) Tj T*
