(This set was called "standard" in v0.8 and renamed to "basic" in v0.9, a deliberate signal that) Tj T*
(production frontends should bring their own catalog, mapping their existing components) Tj T*
(\(your design-system buttons, your charts, your maps\) to A2UI types. The agent doesn't) Tj T*
(change; only the renderer's catalog mapping does \(ChoicePicker was MultipleChoice) Tj T*
(in v0.8.\)) Tj T*
