(Snippet 5: LLM-generates-UI pattern) Tj T*
(Data values flow through a parallel updateDataModel message that resolves the {path:) Tj T*
("/title"} references, so clients can re-render on data updates without re-sending the) Tj T*
(structure. The LLM only sees a structured tool response \(not the rendered UI\) so its context) Tj T*
(stays focused on what to do next, not on the UI it just built.) Tj T*
