(Interactive Artifacts & The Canvas) Tj T*
(Traditional chat interfaces are linear. Each response is static. The canvas approach is) Tj T*
(different: it creates a persistent workspace where both the agent and user can edit.) Tj T*
(Instead of scrolling through chat history, you have a living document. The agent can modify) Tj T*
(sections. You can edit manually. Both changes are reflected in real-time.) Tj T*
