(Page 40 of 49 - 04 - Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(40) Tj T*
(Best Practices) Tj T*
(Let LLMs Generate A2UI) Tj T*
(For the LLM-generates-UI pattern \(the default introduced in 4.2\), hand-coding A2UI) Tj T*
(JSON is tedious. Use the official a2ui-agent-sdk \(pip install a2ui-agent-sdk\): the) Tj T*
(A2uiSchemaManager builds a system prompt that already embeds the catalog schema) Tj T*
(and worked examples, the catalog ships its own JSON-Schema validator, and the same SDK) Tj T*
(provides a parser for the <a2ui-json> blocks the agent emits. Then validate and retry on) Tj T*
(schema errors.) Tj T*
(Python) Tj T*
(# pip install a2ui-agent-sdk google-adk) Tj T*
(import asyncio, json) Tj T*
(import jsonschema) Tj T*
(from a2ui.schema.manager import A2uiSchemaManager) Tj T*
(from a2ui.basic_catalog.provider import BasicCatalog) Tj T*
(from a2ui.schema.constants import VERSION_0_9) Tj T*
(from a2ui.parser.parser import parse_response) Tj T*
(from google.adk.agents import LlmAgent) Tj T*
(from google.adk.models import Gemini) Tj T*
(from google.adk.runners import InMemoryRunner) Tj T*
(from google.genai import types) Tj T*
(# 1. The SDK loads the catalog, builds the validator, and renders a complete) Tj T*
(#    system prompt with the schema and worked examples baked in.) Tj T*
(schema_manager = A2uiSchemaManager\() Tj T*
(version=VERSION_0_9,) Tj T*
(catalogs=[BasicCatalog.get_config\(version=VERSION_0_9\)],) Tj T*
(\)) Tj T*
(catalog = schema_manager.get_selected_catalog\(\)) Tj T*
(Continues next page...) Tj T*
ET
endstream
