(In production, wrap create_ui\(\) in try/except and fall back to a text response on) Tj T*
(schema-validation failure. LLM output is stochastic, and the renderer should never see a) Tj T*
(malformed payload.) Tj T*
(Hybrid Output for Flexibility) Tj T*
(Provide both data and UI so consumers can choose:) Tj T*
(Snippet 7: Hybrid Output Example Schema) Tj T*
(API clients ignore the ui field and use data. Human-facing clients render the A2UI message.) Tj T*
(last_error = e) Tj T*
(path = "/".join\(str\(p\) for p in e.absolute_path\)) Tj T*
(query = \() Tj T*
(f"Your previous response failed schema validation at {path}: ") Tj T*
(f"{e.message[:200]}\\nFix this and retry:) Tj T*
({intent}\\nData: {json.dumps\(data\)}") Tj T*
(\)) Tj T*
(raise ValueError\(f"Schema validation failed after {max_retries}) Tj T*
(retries: {last_error}"\)) Tj T*
(JSON) Tj T*
({) Tj T*
("data": {"sales": [...]},) Tj T*
("ui": {"version": "v0.9", "updateComponents": {"surfaceId": "main",) Tj T*
("components": [...]}},) Tj T*
("ui_available": true) Tj T*
(}) Tj T*
