(Page 44 of 49 - 04 - Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(44) Tj T*
(While earlier sections focused on how coding agents interact with tools, other agents, and) Tj T*
(user interfaces within an Agentic framework, those interactions are often limited to "read") Tj T*
(operations using protocols like MCP, A2A, and A2UI. As these systems evolve, agents must) Tj T*
(transition toward executing "actions" that carry real-world financial implications.) Tj T*
(Prioritizing commerce protocols and building a robust operational harness ensures your) Tj T*
(agents adhere strictly to industry standards when managing transactions.) Tj T*
(To understand how to implement these systems, we must first explore the nature of these) Tj T*
(protocols and their complementary roles.) Tj T*
(What is AP2 and UCP?) Tj T*
(Figure 8: AP2 and UCP Ecosystem) Tj T*
ET
