stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
36 756 Td
13 TL
(Page 45 of 49 - 04 - Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(45) Tj T*
(Imagine you and your roommates are starving at 2:00 AM. You are too busy studying to) Tj T*
(stop, so you deploy your AI Smart Assistant to get food for the apartment.Here is how UCP) Tj T*
(\(Universal Commerce Protocol\) and AP2 \(Agent Payments Protocol\) split the workload to get) Tj T*
(that burrito to your dorm lobby.) Tj T*
(UCP \(Universal Commerce Protocol\): The Ultimate Food Delivery App) Tj T*
(In 2024, your AI would have to manually open Chrome, go to the local burrito place's poorly) Tj T*
(designed website, try to click the "extra guac" checkbox, and hope the site doesn't crash.) Tj T*
(Instead, UCP acts like a universal translator. Every restaurant on campus publishes their) Tj T*
(menu, hours, and customization options in a clean, standard machine language.) Tj T*
(Your AI uses UCP to ask the restaurant's system, "Are you still open? Do you have vegetarian) Tj T*
(burritos?". To build an order one could ask: "One chicken burrito, no onions, add sour) Tj T*
(cream, and a side of chips" and the restaurant responds back with the tax, delivery fee, and) Tj T*
(expected arrival time.) Tj T*
(In short: UCP is how your AI talks to the store, looks at the options, and builds the perfect) Tj T*
(order. Prior to UCP, your application would have been able to discover and get information.) Tj T*
(However the interactions between these different providers need to be orchestrated) Tj T*
(individually. By standardizing the interaction, we make it easier for non-humans to interact) Tj T*
(with each other.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
