(Page 46 of 49 - 04 - Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(Agent Tools & Interoperability) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(46) Tj T*
(AP2 \(Agent Payments Protocol\): The Parent's Credit Card with) Tj T*
(Strict Rules) Tj T*
(Now the food is in the cart, but your AI needs to pay. You obviously aren't going to type your) Tj T*
(actual debit card number into an AI prompt and say "Go wild.") Tj T*
(AP2 is the open, shared protocol that provides a common language for secure, compliant) Tj T*
(transactions between agents and merchants that lets your AI pay for the food only within) Tj T*
(rules you set.) Tj T*
(* The Guardrails \(The Mandate\): Before you send the AI off, you approve a digital rule:) Tj T*
("You can spend up to $25 at Taco Bell.") Tj T*
(* The Handshake: When the AI checks out, it doesn't show your card number. It shows a) Tj T*
(digital, encrypted "promissory note" signed by you that says: "My human approved this) Tj T*
($18.50 order." The restaurant's bank instantly verifies this digital signature.) Tj T*
(* No Hidden Fees: If the restaurant tries to sneakily charge you $50 instead of $18.50, the) Tj T*
(AP2 protocol blocks it instantly because it violates the rules you signed off on.) Tj T*
(In short: AP2 is the secure lockbox that lets your AI pay for things using your money, but) Tj T*
(ensures it can never buy a $1,000 TV by mistake.) Tj T*
(Table 3: Comparison for UCP and AP2) Tj T*
(UCP AP2) Tj T*
(Brain that decides what to buy, handles the menu,) Tj T*
(and puts the food in the cart.) Tj T*
(Is the wallet that securely handles how to pay) Tj T*
(for it without you getting scammed.) Tj T*
(Integrates with any business provider Integrates with payment) Tj T*
(Unified integration:) Tj T*
(Shared language:) Tj T*
(Extensible architecture) Tj T*
(Security-first approach) Tj T*
(Authorization & Auditability) Tj T*
(Authenticity of Intent) Tj T*
(Agent Error and Hallucination) Tj T*
(Accountability) Tj T*
ET
endstream
