(Conclusion) Tj T*
(By adopting foundational standards like MCP, A2A, A2UI, AP2 and UCP, organizations) Tj T*
(can eliminate the crushing technical debt of bespoke integrations and focus entirely) Tj T*
(on orchestrating high-value business logic. This paradigm shift fundamentally elevates) Tj T*
(developers from mere mechanics wiring fragile APIs into true architects of a global,) Tj T*
(autonomous workforce. As these standardized communication layers mature, they will unlock) Tj T*
(entirely new economies of scale, transforming how enterprise software is built, consumed,) Tj T*
